    {
      "name": "happy path — agent resolves successfully, case solved",
      "description": "Started at Fetch past conversations (the message start event Event_WaitForEmail cannot be instantiated via the CPT create-instance API, which requires a none start event). Past conversations fetched. Agent handles request. Agent-as-a-Judge rates AGENT_SUCCESS. Human reviews resolution. Final answer sent. Case solved.",
